# Throwaway Playwright projects the host tests scaffold (T2.8).
#
# They live inside the package rather than in the system temp directory so that
# `@playwright/test` and the host's own dist resolve the way they would in a real
# project — Node walks up to this package's node_modules. Each is removed when
# its test finishes; the ignore is for a run that was killed.
.host-tests/
playwright-report/
test-results/
